WEBVTT

00:15.265 --> 00:16.850
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS

00:22.647 --> 00:24.649
[suspenseful music playing]

00:58.808 --> 00:59.684
[clang]

01:15.116 --> 01:16.326
[growling]

01:32.801 --> 01:34.803
[ominous music playing]

02:15.760 --> 02:17.011
[door opens]

02:54.549 --> 02:55.967
You must never...

02:57.051 --> 02:58.761
look inside His Majesty's bedchamber.

02:59.470 --> 03:00.388
Do you understand?

03:02.182 --> 03:03.600
Yes, my lord.

03:11.858 --> 03:13.860
[suspenseful music playing]

03:21.868 --> 03:23.119
[dishes clang]

04:16.047 --> 04:17.632
[low snarling]

04:23.930 --> 04:25.223
[low snarling continues]

05:06.806 --> 05:08.766
[low snarling]

05:14.605 --> 05:16.482
[snarling continues]

05:25.366 --> 05:27.368
[snarling continues]

05:31.497 --> 05:33.124
[loud snarling]

05:34.625 --> 05:36.044
[man screaming]

05:53.102 --> 05:56.939
THE KING IS DEAD. A NEW WIND WILL BLOW.

06:05.114 --> 06:06.866
- We deserve to die!
- We deserve to die!

06:07.450 --> 06:09.410
Over 100 of the same notice were posted

06:09.827 --> 06:11.537
all over Hanyang last night.

06:12.580 --> 06:14.415
His Majesty, who is very much alive,

06:15.124 --> 06:16.292
has perished?

06:18.836 --> 06:20.213
[horse neighing]

06:24.342 --> 06:26.052
Capture everyone who posted these,

06:26.135 --> 06:28.971
wrote these,
or gave instructions to write these.

06:29.055 --> 06:31.265
Bring in every single one of them.

06:31.682 --> 06:33.601
I shall annihilate their entire families.

06:38.731 --> 06:39.857
The same goes for...

06:41.275 --> 06:44.404
those who did nothing
while these notices went up

06:45.988 --> 06:46.906
throughout the capital.

06:46.989 --> 06:49.242
[whimpering] My lord,
please spare my life.

06:49.325 --> 06:52.954
[man whimpering] My lord, please!
Forgive me, my lord.

06:53.704 --> 06:54.705
- Please, my lord!
- My lord!

06:54.789 --> 06:55.873
Please spare my life!

07:02.505 --> 07:03.881
[door opens]

07:03.965 --> 07:07.260
The Haewon Cho Clan
is rounding up young scholars.

07:10.721 --> 07:12.849
[woman] Goodness.
Oh, my! What are you doing?

07:12.932 --> 07:15.059
No! Gyeong-seok!

07:15.143 --> 07:16.978
Gyeong-seok! Goodness!

07:17.061 --> 07:18.688
Gyeong-seok!

07:18.771 --> 07:20.064
[man groaning]

07:25.945 --> 07:27.071
[officer] Arrest them!

07:29.031 --> 07:30.825
[men grunting]

07:34.203 --> 07:37.540
Ten days have passed
since His Majesty fell ill with smallpox.

07:37.623 --> 07:41.419
The only two people who had seen
His Majesty during the past ten days

07:41.502 --> 07:44.964
are Chief State Councillor Cho Hak-ju
and his daughter, the second Queen.

07:45.047 --> 07:47.383
No wonder those terrible rumors

07:47.467 --> 07:49.844
of His Majesty passing away have spread.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.432
[men screaming in pain]

08:01.272 --> 08:03.191
[screaming, whimpering]

08:07.445 --> 08:08.529
Halt!

08:10.948 --> 08:15.953
We received a report that 89 scholars
from institutions near Hanyang

08:16.037 --> 08:18.581
worked together to post
these heinous notices.

08:18.664 --> 08:20.249
Confess!

08:20.333 --> 08:24.754
The first to confess
will have his life spared!

08:24.837 --> 08:28.257
[scholar]
Who are the real traitors of this nation?

08:28.341 --> 08:31.219
Through the spoils system and extortion,

08:32.428 --> 08:37.225
the evil family of the Queen
is busy feeding themselves.

08:38.267 --> 08:39.227
The traitors?

08:41.646 --> 08:43.689
Look to the Haewon Cho Clan!

08:43.773 --> 08:46.150
How dare you! Shut your mouth!

08:46.234 --> 08:48.402
Those of the Haewon Cho Clan
are but insects

08:49.654 --> 08:51.822
that are sucking the blood of the people.

08:52.490 --> 08:55.535
How do they differ from swine
that eat feces?

08:55.618 --> 08:58.538
Perhaps it is better
for His Majesty to be dead.

08:58.955 --> 09:01.749
He is a feeble king who handed the nation

09:02.333 --> 09:05.878
over to Lord Cho Hak-ju,
the head of those swine!

09:05.962 --> 09:06.963
How dare you?

09:07.713 --> 09:10.967
[man 2] Did you say it is better
for His Majesty to be dead?

09:11.342 --> 09:13.344
Do you admit to treason?

09:27.149 --> 09:29.360
Then to whom are you referring
by "new wind"?

09:30.027 --> 09:32.822
Who is the new king you wish to serve?

09:34.156 --> 09:37.201
Is it the Crown Prince?

09:38.369 --> 09:40.329
TONGMYEONGJEON

10:00.766 --> 10:02.643
[approaching footsteps]

10:11.861 --> 10:12.945
[woman] Your Royal Highness.

10:13.696 --> 10:15.740
You have been at my chambers for days

10:15.823 --> 10:18.034
even though I am not fit to move.

10:18.951 --> 10:21.662
Father has been ill for ten days,

10:22.580 --> 10:24.790
but there is nothing I can do for him.

10:25.833 --> 10:28.544
It devastates me that I cannot fulfill
my duties as his son.

10:30.755 --> 10:33.132
Please permit me to enter
the King's palace

10:33.716 --> 10:35.760
and to stay by Father's side.

10:35.843 --> 10:38.471
Your father is lying ill from smallpox.

10:38.554 --> 10:42.224
If you catch it from him and fall ill
while looking after His Majesty,

10:42.308 --> 10:44.769
who will lead this nation?

10:44.852 --> 10:49.231
As a senior member of the royal family,
I can never permit it, so please leave.

10:52.068 --> 10:53.736
Then, just tell me this.

10:56.656 --> 10:57.990
Is Father...

10:59.033 --> 11:00.242
truly alive?

11:09.168 --> 11:13.506
You may have learned
how to be filial toward your father,

11:14.256 --> 11:17.009
but not toward your mother.

11:17.093 --> 11:20.554
How could you be so disobedient
to me in front of the servants?

11:20.638 --> 11:22.515
Do you hate me that much?

11:24.225 --> 11:28.020
Or is that hatred more toward...

11:30.064 --> 11:31.816
your unborn sibling?

11:33.317 --> 11:35.277
Your Majesty, how dare I...

11:35.361 --> 11:36.696
If that is not the case,

11:38.155 --> 11:39.407
please head back.

11:41.784 --> 11:44.286
What are you waiting for?
Escort the Crown Prince.

11:50.292 --> 11:51.919
[thunder rumbles]

12:10.855 --> 12:12.773
I must see my father.

12:13.899 --> 12:15.484
I will go to the King's palace.

12:18.988 --> 12:20.990
Your Royal Highness, have you forgotten?

12:21.073 --> 12:24.952
The Queen ordered that Your Royal Highness
be kept out of the King's palace.

12:25.035 --> 12:26.078
Step aside.

12:27.204 --> 12:28.581
I said to step aside!

12:31.167 --> 12:32.418
Please be understanding.

12:32.501 --> 12:34.503
Whom do you serve?

12:36.213 --> 12:38.174
Whom do you consider
the King of this nation?

12:38.674 --> 12:40.634
Is it my father or the Haewon Cho Clan?

12:41.635 --> 12:43.721
Is there anyone in the entire palace

12:44.555 --> 12:47.641
who does not follow the orders
of the Haewon Cho Clan?

12:48.309 --> 12:49.351
Your Royal Highness.

12:50.227 --> 12:52.730
- Please be understanding!
- Please be understanding!

12:57.735 --> 12:58.986
Call Mu-yeong.

13:24.637 --> 13:25.846
Your Royal Highness.

13:29.809 --> 13:30.893
[grunts]

13:33.187 --> 13:35.105
[panting]

13:38.818 --> 13:39.777
[sighs]

13:42.530 --> 13:45.908
[Mu-yeong] Why would you throw something
worth more than my year's salary?

13:48.619 --> 13:50.704
If a tantrum is what you wanted to throw,

13:51.622 --> 13:53.332
you should have aimed it at the Queen.

13:53.415 --> 13:56.085
The greatest virtue a crown prince
must pursue is filial piety.

13:56.961 --> 13:59.046
I cannot ignore the virtue
and risk being deposed.

13:59.922 --> 14:02.258
The wench may be barely of age,

14:03.092 --> 14:04.802
but she is my mother nonetheless.

14:04.885 --> 14:05.761
I see.

14:06.637 --> 14:08.681
Your Royal Highness
is a truly devoted son.

14:08.764 --> 14:10.432
I have a job for you.

14:16.063 --> 14:16.939
Is it...

14:18.607 --> 14:22.194
Is it to go to the King's palace
and see His Majesty?

14:23.237 --> 14:25.114
Bring me the journal
kept at the Royal Infirmary.

14:25.197 --> 14:28.868
The palace guards keep an eye
on the journal day and night.

14:28.951 --> 14:30.703
How can I possibly obtain it?

14:30.786 --> 14:34.123
The pears from Naju,
the pomegranates from Gochang,

14:34.206 --> 14:37.126
and the ginger sweets
prepared with care by the Royal Kitchen...

14:39.128 --> 14:41.589
Did you forget all that you stole from me?

14:41.672 --> 14:42.923
Your Royal Highness.

14:43.007 --> 14:44.550
Think of your wife, who supported you

14:44.633 --> 14:47.803
until you finally passed
the state examination at the age of 40.

14:48.512 --> 14:49.346
[sighs]

14:49.430 --> 14:53.017
You stole from my dessert table
in order to bring them to your kind wife

14:53.434 --> 14:56.979
who finally got pregnant
after ten years of marriage, did you not?

14:57.062 --> 14:59.148
Your Royal Highness,
you know of my situation.

15:00.065 --> 15:02.484
How long are you planning to use that
against me?

15:04.320 --> 15:06.989
If they find out
that you stole from my dessert table,

15:07.990 --> 15:09.116
you will be fired.

15:09.199 --> 15:12.119
I will be so if I get caught
stealing the journal.

15:12.202 --> 15:13.537
I see.

15:15.080 --> 15:17.833
I hear tonight's dessert table
will have beef pancakes.

15:19.418 --> 15:20.252
[sighs]

15:20.336 --> 15:23.130
I guess I cannot force you.

15:25.674 --> 15:26.717
[sighs]

15:27.092 --> 15:28.260
[sighs]

15:30.387 --> 15:33.766
If I try to sneak in before sunrise
when the guards change shifts,

15:35.351 --> 15:37.019
I may be able to get the journal.

15:42.566 --> 15:45.986
[Mu-yeong] The guards will not be
as frosty before sunrise.

15:46.403 --> 15:49.531
I may be able to get it
if I sneak in during the shift change.

15:55.829 --> 15:57.539
[suspenseful music playing]

16:07.174 --> 16:08.092
[grunts]

16:42.876 --> 16:44.086
[door opens]

16:56.598 --> 16:58.600
[suspenseful music playing]

17:05.858 --> 17:07.026
[door closes]

17:09.403 --> 17:11.739
[approaching footsteps]

17:24.043 --> 17:25.586
[man] His Majesty went missing?

17:25.669 --> 17:27.171
[man 2] Forgive me.

17:27.254 --> 17:28.964
I only stepped away for a moment--

17:29.048 --> 17:31.383
[man] If you wish to live,
you must find him.

17:31.467 --> 17:32.301
Now!

17:37.431 --> 17:38.766
Father is...

17:39.850 --> 17:40.726
missing?

18:01.371 --> 18:02.664
[floor creaks]

18:04.917 --> 18:06.835
[floor creaking]

18:13.884 --> 18:16.011
[breathes deeply]

18:24.103 --> 18:25.729
[foreboding music playing]

18:39.159 --> 18:40.786
[creature snarling]

18:47.668 --> 18:49.670
[snarling intensifies]

18:56.260 --> 18:59.012
[creature growling]

19:04.852 --> 19:05.686
[snarls]

19:19.825 --> 19:20.826
[thud]

19:44.349 --> 19:46.268
[approaching footsteps]

20:03.744 --> 20:05.746
What are you doing here,
Your Royal Highness?

20:08.290 --> 20:09.374
There was...

20:10.375 --> 20:11.752
something monstrous in the hallway.

20:11.835 --> 20:13.420
Something monstrous?

20:13.837 --> 20:15.214
It sounded like a beast.

20:16.673 --> 20:18.967
It smelled of blood and had a foul stench.

20:19.801 --> 20:22.846
It was not human.
It had the shape of a monster.

20:23.513 --> 20:24.848
That cannot be true.

20:25.641 --> 20:27.226
A monster in the King's palace?

20:28.018 --> 20:29.519
Your Royal Highness must be wrong.

20:29.603 --> 20:31.271
You do not believe me?

20:31.355 --> 20:35.108
Your Royal Highness must be weak
from having knelt in contrition for days.

20:35.692 --> 20:37.486
Please return to your chambers

20:37.569 --> 20:41.198
and have a physician check up on you.

20:42.407 --> 20:44.618
Have His Royal Highness's attendants
escort him.

20:59.216 --> 21:00.509
Did you find my father?

21:00.926 --> 21:02.928
What do you mean?

21:06.431 --> 21:07.641
His Majesty...

21:08.809 --> 21:10.894
is lying in his bed at this very moment.

21:11.436 --> 21:12.980
He is lying in his bed?

21:15.524 --> 21:18.235
I shall simply check for myself then.

21:22.572 --> 21:25.158
[Beom-il]
Your Royal Highness, please stop.

21:25.242 --> 21:26.868
Father, it is Chang.

21:27.286 --> 21:28.745
Please stop, Your Royal Highness.

21:28.829 --> 21:30.122
- [Chang] Open the door.
- No!

21:30.205 --> 21:31.331
Open it at once!

21:37.379 --> 21:39.131
You dare draw

21:40.424 --> 21:41.633
your sword at me?

21:42.467 --> 21:44.428
It is the Queen's orders.

21:45.012 --> 21:46.972
I am only maintaining the laws
of the palace.

21:47.055 --> 21:49.057
Can a mere commander of the Royal Army

21:50.058 --> 21:52.102
shed the blood of the royal family?

21:55.480 --> 21:56.648
If you can,

21:59.318 --> 22:00.277
strike me.

22:13.832 --> 22:15.417
Where is my father?

22:17.336 --> 22:18.211
[Hak-ju] Why?

22:18.879 --> 22:21.631
Are you concerned
about your father's safety?

22:22.049 --> 22:23.216
I saw...

22:24.843 --> 22:27.220
a hideous monster
inside the King's palace.

22:28.805 --> 22:30.182
[Hak-ju] I saw one as well.

22:38.231 --> 22:41.651
A son pretending
to be concerned about his father

22:41.735 --> 22:45.614
when he secretly wishes
for his father to die

22:46.782 --> 22:49.326
so that he can secure safety
and power for himself.

22:49.951 --> 22:52.287
That is the monster I saw.

22:53.413 --> 22:54.623
Not only that,

22:54.706 --> 22:56.333
but I saw monsters

22:57.292 --> 22:58.794
full of evil thoughts

22:59.628 --> 23:02.964
who intend to use that son
to slay His Majesty

23:03.048 --> 23:04.674
and take over this nation.

23:04.758 --> 23:06.676
Those monsters' blood
is filling the courtyard

23:06.760 --> 23:08.845
of the Royal Investigation Bureau.

23:09.262 --> 23:12.849
Once that blood overflows,
the leader of the conspiracy,

23:14.851 --> 23:18.980
the new king they wish to place
on the throne, will be identified.

23:20.357 --> 23:21.483
When the time comes,

23:22.776 --> 23:24.986
even a mere commander of the Royal Army

23:25.862 --> 23:28.448
may shed the blood of the royal family.

23:31.034 --> 23:35.038
Your Royal Highness may continue to wait,
but His Majesty will not return.

23:35.455 --> 23:38.750
His illness subsided,
so he went to the Queen's palace.

23:41.711 --> 23:42.754
Beom-il,

23:44.256 --> 23:45.841
escort His Royal Highness out.

23:46.716 --> 23:47.759
Yes, Father.

24:18.415 --> 24:20.917
His Royal Highness
must have been startled.

24:21.501 --> 24:23.628
Bring him some medicine
to calm his nerves.

24:34.973 --> 24:36.725
[door opens, closes]

24:36.808 --> 24:37.851
[sighs]

24:39.769 --> 24:41.021
[Mu-yeong] Your Royal Highness.

24:43.064 --> 24:44.191
Did you retrieve it?

24:44.983 --> 24:45.817
Yes.

24:45.901 --> 24:49.029
I almost got caught,
but I managed to sneak it out.

24:55.452 --> 24:57.704
Father collapsed ten days ago,

24:58.205 --> 24:59.498
at the end of the month.

25:04.419 --> 25:06.838
"Chills, fever,

25:07.797 --> 25:08.798
and a headache.

25:10.717 --> 25:14.179
Administered the decoction for rashes
numerous times, but it was ineffective.

25:16.640 --> 25:18.975
The fever is too high to be varicella.

25:21.311 --> 25:23.063
The symptoms are severe.

25:25.690 --> 25:27.067
There might not be a cure."

25:29.402 --> 25:32.364
Your Royal Highness,
why are there no more entries?

25:32.447 --> 25:33.573
This cannot be.

25:34.324 --> 25:37.702
Those in the Royal Infirmary must write
an entry every day without fail.

25:38.995 --> 25:41.581
Furthermore,
Father was in critical condition.

25:47.963 --> 25:49.714
Unless they had to hide something

25:51.341 --> 25:53.176
and intentionally omitted entries...

25:56.888 --> 25:59.432
What is happening to my father right now

26:00.684 --> 26:02.519
in his own palace?

26:04.479 --> 26:05.480
Your Royal Highness.

26:08.775 --> 26:10.569
Who is Physician Lee Seung-hui?

26:12.946 --> 26:15.949
He was a royal physician,
but he resigned three years ago.

26:16.950 --> 26:18.243
How do you know of him?

26:19.035 --> 26:22.581
His name is written on the last entry
regarding His Majesty.

26:25.000 --> 26:28.169
PHYSICIAN LEE SEUNG-HUI OF JIYULHEON
IN DONGNAE WAS CALLED INTO THE PALACE

26:32.549 --> 26:33.883
I must go out in disguise.

26:34.426 --> 26:36.553
Pardon? In disguise?

26:36.970 --> 26:40.348
You cannot. Who knows
what the Queen will do to you--

26:40.432 --> 26:42.559
She said not to enter the King's palace.

26:42.642 --> 26:44.936
She did not forbid me
from leaving the palace.

26:45.020 --> 26:46.146
Your Royal Highness!

26:46.688 --> 26:47.856
Prepare to leave.

26:48.607 --> 26:51.026
It will be just you and me.

26:52.485 --> 26:53.570
Then what about...

26:54.946 --> 26:56.031
the beef pancakes?

26:56.448 --> 26:57.449
[sighs]

26:58.825 --> 26:59.826
Shh.

27:04.331 --> 27:07.959
DONGNAE

27:09.502 --> 27:14.549
JIYULHEON

27:21.848 --> 27:22.974
[groans]

27:27.979 --> 27:31.691
Eat a little more.
You will recover faster that way.

27:31.775 --> 27:32.901
I will eat it later.

27:32.984 --> 27:33.818
[bowl clanks]

27:35.445 --> 27:36.863
You call that food?

27:37.822 --> 27:41.201
They will die from starvation
before the disease kills them.

27:44.329 --> 27:48.083
The government promised
to send us some rice soon,

27:48.166 --> 27:49.751
so wait until then.

27:49.834 --> 27:51.419
Like they would.

27:51.920 --> 27:53.797
Dozens of people die every day

27:53.880 --> 27:56.091
waiting for that rice.

27:56.800 --> 27:59.052
[clears throat, spits]

28:00.595 --> 28:01.721
You should rest.

28:19.572 --> 28:20.448
[grunts]

28:21.282 --> 28:22.367
What are you doing?

28:23.284 --> 28:27.163
Those people will become more sick
if they do not eat that,

28:27.622 --> 28:28.873
so watch what you say.

28:36.047 --> 28:37.090
[sniffles]

28:39.217 --> 28:40.301
By the way,

28:40.760 --> 28:42.595
when is Physician Lee coming?

28:42.679 --> 28:45.056
I told you he went to Hanyang.

28:45.140 --> 28:47.183
So, when is he coming back?

28:47.267 --> 28:49.811
I came all the way here
because I heard he was the best.

28:51.187 --> 28:52.605
Your wound will heal quickly

28:53.648 --> 28:56.067
if you shut your trap,

28:57.026 --> 28:58.319
so be on your way.

28:58.653 --> 28:59.571
[scoffs]

29:00.405 --> 29:01.656
[chuckles] What did you just...

29:03.450 --> 29:04.617
What the...

29:08.705 --> 29:09.956
What are you looking at?

29:20.133 --> 29:20.967
[sighs]

29:21.050 --> 29:23.762
[woman] The medicine is ineffective
since they don't eat much.

29:24.179 --> 29:25.388
This is bad.

29:27.015 --> 29:29.058
- Physician Lee has returned!
- Hurry!

29:29.142 --> 29:30.393
[man] Physician Lee is back!

29:30.977 --> 29:32.979
[indistinct chatter]

29:34.981 --> 29:36.191
[man 2] There he is!

29:37.442 --> 29:39.444
[ominous music playing]

30:01.007 --> 30:02.258
Welcome back, Master.

30:03.134 --> 30:04.344
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

30:06.471 --> 30:09.265
What is that, Master?

30:16.397 --> 30:17.732
Prepare for a funeral.

30:18.858 --> 30:19.692
Pardon?

30:20.735 --> 30:22.821
Whose funeral do you mean?

30:30.662 --> 30:31.830
[man 3 whispers] Over here.

30:34.582 --> 30:36.459
Help me with this.

30:39.379 --> 30:40.547
Let's open it.

30:46.719 --> 30:47.720
[all gasp]

30:48.847 --> 30:49.931
- [man 4] My gosh.
- [woman 2] It is Dan-i!

30:50.014 --> 30:51.850
- [man 4] Oh, my. Dan-i!
- [woman 2] My goodness.

30:51.933 --> 30:53.393
- What happened?
- What happened to him?

30:53.476 --> 30:54.811
[crowd clamoring]

30:55.687 --> 30:57.647
- Oh, my.
- [man 4] Dan-i...

30:58.189 --> 30:59.524
What happened to Dan-i?

31:00.233 --> 31:01.860
[woman 2] How could this happen to him?

31:04.946 --> 31:05.905
[Seo-bi] Master!

31:06.447 --> 31:09.993
Master, what happened? Please tell me!

31:10.702 --> 31:13.246
What happened in Hanyang

31:14.247 --> 31:17.083
that Dan-i returned
in such a gruesome state?

31:19.210 --> 31:20.461
Please tell me, Master.

31:27.844 --> 31:29.095
Nothing happened.

31:30.889 --> 31:31.931
Nothing.

31:33.933 --> 31:35.143
Nothing happened.

31:45.862 --> 31:47.739
HANYANG

31:47.822 --> 31:52.535
It says they will depose His Majesty,
have the Crown Prince take the throne,

31:53.244 --> 31:56.205
and create a new world.

31:57.373 --> 32:00.835
This is conclusive evidence of treason.

32:02.128 --> 32:05.256
We must bring the Crown Prince
to the Royal Investigation Bureau

32:05.340 --> 32:07.300
and interrogate him right away.

32:07.383 --> 32:12.013
Where and how did you find the letter?

32:12.472 --> 32:15.058
Someone reported that one of the scholars

32:15.141 --> 32:17.936
who was arrested had this letter at home.

32:18.019 --> 32:20.271
What a useful informant.

32:20.355 --> 32:24.359
He knew every single one
of the 89 scholars who committed treason

32:24.442 --> 32:27.654
and where the secret letter
that no one knew about was kept.

32:28.655 --> 32:30.323
Who is this informant?

32:30.823 --> 32:33.242
Why is that important?

32:36.245 --> 32:40.541
None of the 89 scholars
admitted to the allegation of treason.

32:40.625 --> 32:41.542
Yet,

32:42.335 --> 32:46.005
you are accusing them of treason based on
the statement of that single informant.

32:46.464 --> 32:48.841
This is an insult
to the Confucian scholars,

32:48.925 --> 32:50.176
the foundation of this nation.

32:50.259 --> 32:51.844
[laughs]

32:53.096 --> 32:56.808
Are the Confucian scholars
really the foundation of this nation?

32:58.810 --> 33:00.103
What did those Confucian scholars

33:01.145 --> 33:03.231
ever do for this nation?

33:03.690 --> 33:04.816
What are you saying?

33:07.443 --> 33:09.278
Two disastrous wars

33:10.613 --> 33:12.490
swept through this land.

33:14.617 --> 33:15.576
Do you know...

33:16.703 --> 33:19.497
why we were defeated so helplessly?

33:21.457 --> 33:23.376
It is because weak Confucian scholars,

33:23.960 --> 33:26.254
who only blabbed of the Analects
and Mencius

33:26.713 --> 33:29.132
without taking any action,
led this nation.

33:30.550 --> 33:32.135
The same holds true today.

33:32.218 --> 33:34.887
You are completely out of line,
Chief State Councillor.

33:37.306 --> 33:39.100
[grunting]
What do you think you are doing?

33:39.183 --> 33:40.601
Can you not see?

33:41.936 --> 33:43.563
Should I help you see it better?

33:44.355 --> 33:45.565
[grunting]

33:45.648 --> 33:48.901
Now do you see what it says?

33:48.985 --> 33:51.320
It says they will tear down the King,

33:51.863 --> 33:53.740
disturb the order,

33:53.823 --> 33:57.118
and create chaos,
thus leading this nation to ruin.

33:57.201 --> 33:58.911
After reading such a horrendous letter,

33:58.995 --> 34:02.915
should the members of the Court
sit around and argue about

34:02.999 --> 34:07.295
what should be done while doing nothing
as they did during those wars?

34:07.920 --> 34:08.880
Lord Cho,

34:09.922 --> 34:11.215
that is enough.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.801
[breathes heavily]

34:14.802 --> 34:16.262
[sighs]

34:22.685 --> 34:25.980
Arrest the Crown Prince and bring him
to the Royal Investigation Bureau.

34:26.064 --> 34:28.066
[suspenseful music playing]

34:36.908 --> 34:38.326
[Beom-il] Where is the Crown Prince?

34:39.035 --> 34:40.161
[eunuch] We do not know.

34:45.666 --> 34:49.420
Give me the same answer again,
and you will lose your neck.

34:51.631 --> 34:53.257
Where is the Crown Prince?

34:54.342 --> 34:57.261
- [whimpering] I truly do not--
- If I may answer,

34:57.804 --> 35:00.056
we have been searching for him all day,

35:00.139 --> 35:02.642
but he is nowhere
within the Crown Prince's palace.

35:03.267 --> 35:05.019
You saw for yourself, did you not?

35:08.231 --> 35:09.190
Find the Crown Prince!

35:09.607 --> 35:11.192
Search the palace and Hanyang,

35:11.275 --> 35:13.277
and drag him
to the Royal Investigation Bureau.

35:14.362 --> 35:15.947
The Crown Prince is no longer...

35:17.073 --> 35:18.658
the heir to the throne.

35:19.367 --> 35:21.661
He is a criminal who conspired treason.

35:23.996 --> 35:25.039
[woman exhales]

35:29.502 --> 35:30.670
[grunts]

35:32.463 --> 35:33.422
[woman gasps]

35:37.677 --> 35:38.761
[eunuch groans]

35:48.896 --> 35:50.773
Gosh.

35:56.237 --> 35:57.155
Is anyone there?

35:57.238 --> 36:00.158
[flies buzzing]

36:02.910 --> 36:04.495
It is taking a bath. [laughs]

36:07.957 --> 36:09.208
[Mu-yeong] Is anyone there?

36:09.292 --> 36:10.293
[man] Sure, sure.

36:11.043 --> 36:14.005
Are you Park Jong-yeong,
an orderly at the Royal Infirmary?

36:14.088 --> 36:15.548
[stammering] Yes, I am.

36:18.176 --> 36:22.597
What brings
the Crown Prince's personal guard by?

36:22.680 --> 36:25.308
I am looking for Physician Lee Seung-hui
from Dongnae.

36:25.391 --> 36:26.726
He entered the palace

36:26.809 --> 36:29.020
on the third of the month
when you were on duty.

36:29.562 --> 36:32.106
I do not know his name,

36:32.190 --> 36:35.443
but the physician from Dongnae
has left already.

36:35.818 --> 36:39.322
The lad who came with him
got severely ill, so they had to return.

36:41.365 --> 36:43.201
Ask what his symptoms were like.

36:45.119 --> 36:47.246
Why was the lad in critical condition?

36:48.039 --> 36:49.207
Did he catch smallpox?

36:49.290 --> 36:52.752
[sighs]
A dullard like me does not know for sure,

36:53.336 --> 36:54.921
but it was not a disease.

36:55.004 --> 36:57.089
He had deep wounds all over his body.

36:57.924 --> 37:02.094
It looked as if he was bitten
by a huge beast.

37:11.479 --> 37:14.148
Your Royal Highness, we must hurry.

37:14.774 --> 37:16.984
We will get caught at this rate.
We must hurry back.

37:17.944 --> 37:21.530
That way is south,
so Dongnae must be in that direction.

37:23.032 --> 37:24.367
I need to know

37:25.326 --> 37:27.954
what happened to my father
and to the royal family

37:29.163 --> 37:30.665
of this nation.

37:30.748 --> 37:32.166
What do you mean?

37:33.292 --> 37:34.418
I must go to Dongnae.

37:34.835 --> 37:35.920
To Dongnae?

37:37.630 --> 37:38.464
Now?

37:41.842 --> 37:45.012
Without eunuchs or court ladies
to serve you?

37:45.096 --> 37:46.764
You and I alone?

37:47.181 --> 37:48.182
We cannot.

37:48.266 --> 37:49.600
I shall go.

37:49.684 --> 37:52.561
Do you know how far it is
from Hanyang to Dongnae?

37:53.604 --> 37:57.066
You almost vomited several times
on the way here from the palace

37:57.149 --> 37:58.693
because of the stench.

37:58.776 --> 38:00.945
How will you make it
all the way to Dongnae

38:01.445 --> 38:04.657
on such rough and difficult roads?
It is nearly 350km away.

38:04.740 --> 38:08.494
My life until now has been more difficult
than that.

38:08.577 --> 38:10.037
What about your meals?

38:10.830 --> 38:13.916
You won't have
the delicacies you enjoy in the palace.

38:14.000 --> 38:15.084
I do not care.

38:15.167 --> 38:17.378
We could encounter bandits or rioters.

38:18.004 --> 38:19.297
They might kill us.

38:19.964 --> 38:21.549
I will die anyway...

38:22.717 --> 38:24.010
if I remain here.

38:24.427 --> 38:26.304
Because of the allegation of treason?

38:26.887 --> 38:29.640
Your Royal Highness,
even the Haewon Cho Clan

38:29.724 --> 38:32.810
cannot harm you
for something you did not do.

38:35.438 --> 38:36.522
I did it.

38:37.648 --> 38:38.566
Pardon?

38:40.401 --> 38:41.610
May I beg your pardon?

38:41.694 --> 38:42.528
I...

38:44.071 --> 38:45.740
conspired treason against Father.

38:47.908 --> 38:48.951
Why?

38:51.078 --> 38:51.912
How...

38:53.331 --> 38:57.293
You are the Crown Prince.
The throne would have been yours anyway.

38:57.376 --> 38:58.586
So why?

38:59.170 --> 39:03.049
IT HAS ITS MEANING IN CREATING A NEW WORLD

39:07.303 --> 39:10.848
LEE CHANG

39:24.612 --> 39:25.821
Crown Prince...

39:27.406 --> 39:28.449
That is correct.

39:29.742 --> 39:31.619
I am the Crown Prince of this nation.

39:33.329 --> 39:35.122
I am my father's only son,

39:35.623 --> 39:38.417
but I shall die if the Queen
gives birth to a legitimate son.

39:39.001 --> 39:41.670
I am but an illegitimate Crown Prince
born of a concubine.

39:43.672 --> 39:45.132
That was why.

39:45.841 --> 39:47.134
Because I wanted to live.

39:49.011 --> 39:50.096
[gasps]

39:52.681 --> 39:54.809
- Still--
- I still feel the same way.

39:56.394 --> 40:00.106
Many scholars are dying at the Royal
Investigation Bureau to protect me.

40:00.189 --> 40:02.274
The only way to save them and myself...

40:03.526 --> 40:05.361
is in the south, in Dongnae.

40:06.654 --> 40:09.198
I must go to Dongnae,
meet Physician Lee Seung-hui,

40:10.157 --> 40:11.992
and find out

40:12.868 --> 40:14.286
what happened to my father.

40:16.580 --> 40:17.540
Hey!

40:23.712 --> 40:25.589
- [sighs]
- [horse neighs]

40:26.257 --> 40:27.258
Hey!

40:36.142 --> 40:38.227
[Jong-yeong]
All I said was that he took the lad home

40:38.727 --> 40:41.647
because he was in critical condition.

40:42.064 --> 40:45.526
[crying] Forgive me, my lord!

40:45.609 --> 40:46.610
I am sure

40:47.236 --> 40:50.030
the Crown Prince went to Dongnae
in search of Physician Lee.

40:50.114 --> 40:52.283
I told you before, did I not?

40:53.075 --> 40:55.453
We should have silenced Lee Seung-hui
by killing him.

40:57.746 --> 40:58.956
Physician Lee...

41:00.166 --> 41:02.293
is still valuable to us.

41:02.376 --> 41:03.335
However,

41:05.129 --> 41:06.672
the Crown Prince is not.

41:17.016 --> 41:20.311
[Hak-ju] Our messengers will not arrive
ahead of the Crown Prince.

41:21.312 --> 41:24.356
You must go and stop him yourselves.

41:25.149 --> 41:27.610
A cavalry of ten on speedy horses
will head out first,

41:28.819 --> 41:32.031
and 50 competent soldiers
of the Royal Army shall follow.

41:32.990 --> 41:36.285
You must stop him
before he reaches Dongnae

41:36.952 --> 41:38.537
and Jiyulheon.

41:39.330 --> 41:41.415
Even if it means you have to kill him.

41:42.082 --> 41:45.294
HANYANG, DONGNAE

41:46.045 --> 41:50.633
DONGNAE

42:05.981 --> 42:07.316
I can't stop thinking about...

42:10.110 --> 42:11.153
the strange wounds

42:12.238 --> 42:13.572
on Dan-i's body.

42:19.370 --> 42:20.204
Let's go.

42:32.174 --> 42:33.842
I see smoke from the chimney.

42:36.804 --> 42:37.846
What is going on?

42:43.727 --> 42:46.105
[man]
It has been so long since I last had meat.

42:48.983 --> 42:50.985
[indistinct chatter]

42:55.239 --> 42:56.824
[man 2] I feel much better now.

42:57.283 --> 42:59.952
- This is so good!
- [man 3] Can I have another bowl?

43:02.788 --> 43:04.582
This is so delicious. [laughs]

43:04.665 --> 43:06.625
- What is that?
- This is unbelievably delicious!

43:28.731 --> 43:29.607
What is all this?

43:30.566 --> 43:32.151
Is it not obvious?

43:33.527 --> 43:35.404
The patients are starving to death,

43:36.363 --> 43:38.866
but the physician is holed up in his room.

43:40.451 --> 43:43.787
I needed food to live, so I hunted a deer.

43:43.871 --> 43:45.039
A deer?

43:46.373 --> 43:48.500
You found a deer in the mountains?

43:50.127 --> 43:51.962
Did you get the government's permission?

43:52.463 --> 43:54.757
Should we get permission to die too?

43:55.966 --> 43:58.218
People here complain even if I bring food.

44:01.263 --> 44:03.182
[man laughs]

44:03.265 --> 44:05.392
[indistinct chatter]

44:17.154 --> 44:19.198
[laughter]

44:20.491 --> 44:21.575
[baby crying]

44:21.659 --> 44:26.372
My lady. I am sorry to ask,
but could I have some more?

44:26.955 --> 44:29.958
My wife is trying to breastfeed the baby,
but having trouble.

44:30.042 --> 44:31.669
- Sure.
- Thank you.

44:42.137 --> 44:43.430
[sniffs]

44:51.397 --> 44:53.148
[baby crying]

44:54.692 --> 44:56.902
It is all right. Do not cry.

45:01.281 --> 45:02.783
[eerie music playing]

45:03.951 --> 45:05.494
[gasps, shouts]

45:51.832 --> 45:52.958
What?

45:54.710 --> 45:57.171
How could you do this?

45:57.963 --> 46:00.174
- How could you?
- What are you talking about?

46:00.716 --> 46:01.842
I saw it.

46:03.427 --> 46:04.428
I saw it.

46:06.680 --> 46:08.515
How could you do that to a person?

46:09.057 --> 46:10.058
How could you...

46:11.018 --> 46:13.520
He was like family to us.

46:13.604 --> 46:15.105
Who cares what he was to you?

46:17.524 --> 46:19.943
Once you die, you are nothing
but a slab of meat.

46:21.695 --> 46:23.197
Are you out of your mind?

46:24.865 --> 46:27.659
He was a person, just like us.

46:28.744 --> 46:30.162
How can a person

46:30.829 --> 46:32.873
eat another person?

46:32.956 --> 46:33.957
So what?

46:36.794 --> 46:38.504
Should we all just starve to death

46:40.130 --> 46:42.633
arguing about what we ought to do
as human beings?

46:43.842 --> 46:44.968
If everyone lived that way,

46:45.052 --> 46:47.429
half the population of Dongnae
would have starved to death.

46:47.513 --> 46:49.014
What do you mean?

46:49.556 --> 46:52.184
How do you think the people
in the south survived?

46:52.267 --> 46:53.185
Ah.

46:53.852 --> 46:55.938
Do you think His Majesty saved them?

46:56.021 --> 46:59.024
No. What saved them...

47:00.609 --> 47:03.529
were the flesh and bones of neighbors
who starved to death.

47:08.075 --> 47:09.159
That cannot be true.

47:10.244 --> 47:12.120
You live as you wish to live.

47:13.664 --> 47:15.958
I will do whatever I need to do
to stay alive.

47:18.669 --> 47:19.962
[sighs] It is delicious.

47:20.045 --> 47:22.047
[chuckles softly]

47:24.424 --> 47:26.301
Jong-gu! Are you all right?

47:26.927 --> 47:28.387
What is it? What is wrong?

47:28.470 --> 47:30.347
[retching]

47:30.931 --> 47:31.932
Jong-gu!

47:33.517 --> 47:34.643
Jong-gu!

47:35.519 --> 47:36.436
Jong-gu!

47:36.520 --> 47:37.646
[choking]

47:37.729 --> 47:40.065
Jong-gu! Jong-gu!

47:40.941 --> 47:42.901
[man groaning]

47:46.697 --> 47:48.490
[groaning continues]

47:50.075 --> 47:52.202
Jong-gu! Jong-gu!

47:58.375 --> 47:59.459
Jong-gu.

48:00.294 --> 48:01.253
Jong-gu!

48:10.888 --> 48:12.890
[groaning]

48:19.855 --> 48:21.857
[screaming in pain]

48:28.155 --> 48:30.157
[suspenseful music playing]

48:38.165 --> 48:39.166
Master!

48:48.759 --> 48:49.885
[gasps]

49:01.188 --> 49:03.065
[creature growls]

49:24.169 --> 49:25.879
[man retching]

49:30.509 --> 49:31.510
Mister.

49:32.594 --> 49:33.595
Mister!

49:34.763 --> 49:35.639
Mister, hold on!

49:41.269 --> 49:42.145
Mister!

49:43.981 --> 49:45.565
[man grunting]

49:58.954 --> 50:00.205
- [grunting]
- [panting]

50:36.908 --> 50:37.909
[child roars]

50:39.411 --> 50:40.829
Do you have anything more to say?

50:42.873 --> 50:44.124
[woman screams]

50:57.554 --> 50:59.389
[snarling]

52:12.420 --> 52:13.505
[roaring]

52:27.519 --> 52:29.521
[theme music playing]

56:15.497 --> 56:17.290
[music ends]
